# Slopes level: hold right from the left plateau. The ball rolls down the
# 45° slope picking up speed past the normal top speed, stays on the ground
# over the 1:2 hill, and climbs the 45° slope onto the right plateau
# (plateau top y=208, ball y=200).
level slopes
45 R
expect ball.grounded == 1
expect ball.vx > 150
15 R
expect ball.y == 280
expect ball.vx > 200
30 R
expect ball.grounded == 1
150 R
expect ball.x > 420
expect ball.y == 200
expect ball.grounded == 1
